Package: varunayan
Type: Package
Title: Download and Process Climate Data from ERA5, IMD, HadEX3, and CRU TS
Version: 0.1.0.9001
Authors@R: c(person("Saket", "Choudhary", email = "saketc@iitb.ac.in", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5202-7633")))
Description: R package for downloading and processing ERA5 climate data, IMD
    (Indian Meteorological Department) gridded data, and HadEX3 global climate
    extremes (ETCCDI indices) for custom geographical regions. Provides functions to
    extract climate data using bounding boxes, GeoJSON polygons, or point coordinates
    and calculate heat indices. Supports various temporal frequencies and spatial
    resolutions with analysis-ready outputs.
